<Layout title="About" description="About Dealer AI Plugins, the open-source ChatGPT and Codex workflow library for car dealerships published by Dealer Growth Hackers.">
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> About the project</div>
    <h1>Dealer expertise, packaged for AI.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Dealer AI Plugins is an open-source collection of dealership-specific workflows for ChatGPT and Codex. Each plugin focuses on a recognizable operating job—from auditing Google Business Profile performance to reviewing VDP merchandising and measuring AI referral traffic.</p>
      <h2>Publisher</h2>
      <p>The library is created and published by <a href="https://dealergrowthhackers.com/">Dealer Growth Hackers</a> under the MIT license. The plugins are vendor-neutral and expose their complete instructions, references, and templates for review.</p>
      <h2>Editorial standard</h2>
      <p>Every package is reviewed for a clear trigger, defined inputs and outputs, honest limitations, provider-neutral tool guidance, and compatibility with current ChatGPT, Codex, and OpenAI plugin packaging.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
